WEBVTT

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:10.880
I'm so bored.

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:16.170
Alto's stuck in his test…
wonder if I can buy something sweet around here.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:20.580
Man, sounds like this year's practical
was really tough for everyone.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.580
Oh, absolutely.

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.210
That means the written must be tougher this year, too.

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:29.460
At least it will mean the mages that pass
will be far more skilled.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:36.830
Eh, I don't think that'll be a problem for my Master.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:42.920
Honestly, he's more than just studious. He's obsessed.

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:42.580
Studying

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:42.580
Practice

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:43.460
All-nighters

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:43.460
Studying

00:00:42.590 --> 00:00:43.460
Practice

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:46.130
Why does he push himself so hard?

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.630
I want to be stronger. Strong enough to protect Vermeil!

00:00:52.790 --> 00:00:56.630
Ugh! I just want the test to be over with!

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:03.750
All right.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:07.670
After skimming the test, it doesn't look like
I'll get stuck on any questions.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:13.130
The calculations for Question 4 will take time, though,
so I'll skip it for now…

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:18.790
He's sleeping?!

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:23.250
Th-the test just started! Is this guy right in the head?

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:27.960
Gah! I don't have time to worry
about someone else! I have to focus!

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:32.540
I'm going to pass this exam
and get promoted to Bronze Square!

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:04.080
Black or white? Tangled up, they turn gray

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:07.380
Everything always seems so ambiguous

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:13.290
I walk by your side as you smile, helpless

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:16.670
Admiration clear as day

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:19.960
Shining out across the endless distance

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:25.710
Cast a spell on this pitiful situation with an Abracada-Boo

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:31.960
There's a loneliness hidden beneath the darkness in your eyes

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:38.710
I wish I could embrace it with a gentle song

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:43.250
Even the whole world starts to shout it's all a lie,

00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:46.170
As long as you are as you are

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:52.380
I'll sweep through with a glimmering wind and scream out the truth

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:55.960
Even if the whole world yells out that it's a sin,

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:58.750
Even if I'm all on my own

00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:01.830
I want to keep learning to understand you

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:07.330
I'm on your side, I'll protect you

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:16.290
QUESTIONS

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:17.460
I got this feeling on the practical, too,

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:20.750
but the questions seem harder than previous years.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:21.920
Sure, I can handle them, but…

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.750
This one's asking to calculate the interference
and resonance for more than two formulae.

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:30.170
Shouldn't a question like this
be on the Silver Square exam?

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:34.170
The Ministry of Magic might've gone a little too far
when they made these questions…

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:38.920
Good nap!

00:03:38.920 --> 00:03:41.000
H-he was asleep this whole time?!

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:45.460
Unfortunately, he doesn't have enough time now
to get through every question…

00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:52.630
All right, let's look at this Bronze Square exam.

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:01.960
All done!

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:03.540
Huh?

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:07.170
He's done?! Who is this guy?!

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:10.630
How 'bout you? You finished? Super easy, right?

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:12.580
Wh-why's he talking to me?!

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:15.330
Whoa, you're actually explaining your answer?!

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:17.420
You don't need to do that! Just write the answer!

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:20.080
Stop, stop, stop, we're in the middle of the test!

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:22.540
You two! Stop talking over there!

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:23.920
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:29.670
What the hell? Way to be rude.

00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:31.960
Whoa, whoa, can you please stop?

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:37.500
Why should I? Not like anyone's
gonna finish the test today, anywho.

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:40.130
What's that supposed to mean?

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:43.290
Pardon the interruption, sir, but it's urgent!

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:44.960
It better be urgent, they're still taking the test.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:46.460
To hell with the exam!

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:49.880
A student was found dead in the restroom!

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:52.170
What?!

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:55.170
That can't be right,
we have every student accounted for…

00:04:57.290 --> 00:05:00.920
Boy, you guys figured that out faster than I thought.

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:02.080
Huh?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:21.960
No…

00:05:24.130 --> 00:05:24.960
Alto!

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:35.630
Y'know, it was kinda fun taking the test.
Reminded me of the good old days.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.540
But whatever.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.710
Wh-who are you?

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:44.330
Me? Quickest explanation, I'm your enemy...

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.750
...little Demon Master.

00:05:48.380 --> 00:05:50.460
Wait, is he...

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:52.710
You there! Stop right there!

00:05:56.130 --> 00:06:00.290
I am First Lieutenant Mackenzer,
and by the authority of the Royal Militia,

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.040
I hereby place you under arrest
for murder and destruction of property!

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:04.960
Raise your hands and come quietly!

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:12.500
Pipe down, would you?

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.670
I'm in the middle of something here.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.080
All right, whatcha gonna do?

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:23.210
I knew it! He's the one who helped Professor Obsidian…

00:06:24.290 --> 00:06:25.580
Watch out, MacKenzer!

00:06:34.630 --> 00:06:35.460
Alto!

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.170
Vermeil!

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:39.170
He's dangerous! Cover me!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.830
O-on it!

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.580
He blocked Vermeil's attack?!

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.750
Nice! This is fun!

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.420
You hang in there, MacKenzer!

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:59.080
C-Colonel… I'm all right!

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:05.460
Not bad, old man.
Most people can't kick through my rook's armor.

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:09.630
I know you. You're Iolite of Heaven's Will!

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:10.790
Huh?

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:14.580
H-Heaven's Will? So he's...

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:15.580
That's right.

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:23.170
That's Iolite of Heaven's Will, the youngest mage
to be promoted to Platinum Square!

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:26.460
He's a prodigy that outclasses
every other mage out there!

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:35.580
Though I believe there was one person
who got a perfect score on every exam.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:44.080
Bronze, Silver, Gold, every exam, every question correct.

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:48.670
No way… that's him?

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:54.580
Some've said his ability to create life
was stolen from God himself.

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:57.580
Why is a prodigy like you doing something like this?

00:07:58.170 --> 00:08:00.580
Stop it, you're making me blush!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:05.000
You're Colonel Pharanx of the Royal Mage Corps, yeah?

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:07.710
The expert in battle magic.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:11.830
And that lady over there is glaring holes into me.

00:08:16.040 --> 00:08:17.750
Wow, am I the baddie?

00:08:17.920 --> 00:08:18.960
Alto!

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:21.880
Let go of me! Alto's still in there!

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:23.920
Hey! Come on, get out of here, hurry!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.830
No! Alto!

00:08:26.210 --> 00:08:27.250
Lilia!

00:08:27.630 --> 00:08:33.920
You certainly let everyone escape rather easily.
You sure you don't need hostages?

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:38.460
Hostages? C'mon, I wouldn't stoop to that level.

00:08:58.710 --> 00:09:03.080
Oh yeah, there's one thing I wanted to ask you.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:08.170
You don't actually think you can stop me, do you?

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.540
Let me in! Alto's still in there!

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:20.460
Are you insane?! Let us handle this! You three evacuate!

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:24.330
I don't care! Alto is still inside the building!

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.130
Could we just take a look inside?

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.960
We're going to assist the Colonel. Follow me!

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:31.880
Alto!

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.210
Hey, you!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:35.250
Dammit! Let's go!

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:37.170
Lilia…

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:38.250
All right, let's go, too!

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:39.080
Right!

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:41.960
O-okay, let's go, too!

00:09:41.960 --> 00:09:42.580
Right!

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:46.040
Lilia?!

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:47.710
Cheryl? Why'd you come, too?

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:50.540
You guys?!

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:57.670
This is transference magic…

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:01.000
And on such a huge scale…

00:10:27.750 --> 00:10:28.880
Vermeil!

00:11:09.330 --> 00:11:12.880
Man, I'm invincible!

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:16.000
I-impossible.

00:11:16.670 --> 00:11:18.250
He's too powerful.

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:21.960
Figured not even demons could handle me.

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:26.630
Kohakumiya and the gang should've been able
to take you out on their own…

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:35.130
Really? What're you doing?

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:39.460
Let go of Vermeil!

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:42.790
Alto!

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:55.040
That's the same thing I saw during the practical exam!

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:59.880
Golden light… the mana of a demon.

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:05.170
Makes sense, seeing as you and her have…

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:15.500
Really?!

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:25.750
Silver mana?!

00:12:26.790 --> 00:12:29.750
Is this Alto's…

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:36.130
I promised her! I promised I'd protect her!

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:46.750
Wait, you're actually serious!

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.130
No way!

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:07.540
I'm going... to protect her!

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.170
Alto!

00:13:29.880 --> 00:13:35.380
I'm impressed. You got me to pull out my knights.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:44.000
Huh. All right.

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:48.880
Has no one seriously figured you out yet?

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:51.960
Sheesh, everyone's so dumb.

00:13:54.960 --> 00:13:59.080
What are you going to do with Vermeil...?

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:00.920
Huh?

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:06.290
Oh, right. I haven't told you what my plan is.

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:10.920
It's simple. Same thing every cliché bad guy wants to do.

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:15.710
We're gonna destroy the world.

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:23.880
To do that, though, we're gonna need her
and the other demons' powers.

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:32.080
C'mon, don't be so upset.
Demons aren't all that good to begin with.

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:40.710
Iolite!

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:41.750
Calm down.

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:49.790
Things are just getting fun.

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:52.210
You wouldn't want to die before you get to watch.

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:02.830
Wow. Does that mean you're getting "serious"?

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:06.460
I'm going to take you out, here and now!

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.130
What the...?

00:15:23.630 --> 00:15:25.130
C'mon, now.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:29.130
If you're gonna get serious,
then you'd better give it everything you've got.

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:41.670
All right, let's have a little fun with-

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.750
Stay away from Vermeil...!

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:55.670
Sheesh, don't be such a party pooper.

00:15:56.750 --> 00:16:03.630
Don't worry. I'll make good use of her, all right?

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:13.460
Yeah right... I'm not letting a creep like you have her!

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:18.500
I'm... Vermeil's master!

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:25.670
You don't have to do this. I was gonna let you go.
Why're you being so annoying?

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:35.250
If you're gonna be mad, get mad at the guy
who fell in love with his familiar.

00:16:39.830 --> 00:16:42.630
Vermeil, I…

00:16:58.710 --> 00:16:59.960
What?

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:13.630
The book that Vermeil was sealed in?!

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:34.630
Hello. We meet again.

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:39.460
I saw her in my dream…

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:42.080
Who are you?

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:48.290
Me? I am the Mage of Beginnings.

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:53.170
I was the first to reach that which you call
the "Depths" of magical knowledge.

00:17:54.080 --> 00:18:00.290
And I was the mage who sealed Vermeil in this book.

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:06.080
What's an ancient mage like you
popping out of that book for at a time like this?

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:10.540
Doesn't seem like you're actually "alive," either.

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:16.040
The apparition before you now is not truly me.

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:19.920
Perhaps you would call it a lingering memory?

00:18:20.710 --> 00:18:23.040
The day Vermeil was sealed in this book,

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:27.580
I buried a part of myself within it
to prepare for the day that would one day come.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.670
So you're the one who sealed her away!

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:37.290
Oh, do not be so quick to blame.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:41.330
She told me to seal her away.

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:44.250
I merely provided her with assistance.

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:45.460
Huh?

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:49.330
You may have an inkling
as to why she made that request.

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:54.960
Because I did LOTS of naughty things.

00:18:57.580 --> 00:19:00.960
Vermeil asked to be sealed away?

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:17.460
Now, the only thing imprisoning her are memories.

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:18.920
Her memories?

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:21.290
Trauma, if you will.

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:26.630
Emotion and memory sometimes become chains
stronger than magic itself.

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:33.250
A question. Are you prepared to accept her for all she is?

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:37.920
Will you embrace the woman
known as the strongest scourge?

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:39.830
I will.

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:46.330
I have strong feelings for Vermeil,
though I'm not entirely sure what they all mean…

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:52.580
Still, no matter what might happen,

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:57.580
I'm always going to stand by Vermeil!

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:03.420
I see. Then I can entrust you with this burden.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:05.960
If you are ready, then proceed.

00:20:06.500 --> 00:20:10.420
Don't worry. I will lead you to her.

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:15.250
A key?

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:22.880
Hold on. I've got no idea what's going on,
but are you really gonna leave me out of it?

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:26.790
Don't fret. This will be over quickly.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.580
I don't think so!

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:35.710
After all, time does not exist...

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.130
...in the world of the mind.

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:57.500
Where am I?

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:05.540
We are inside her mind,
within the world of memories she wishes to forget.

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:08.210
Wait, what about Iolite?!

00:21:09.750 --> 00:21:14.540
Worry not. The world of memory
is detached from time and space.

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:18.920
The time that passes here
means nothing to the physical world.

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:22.000
But do be careful.

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:30.250
If you cannot save her, then your mind
will be trappeed in this world forevermore.

00:21:31.210 --> 00:21:38.130
This took place 550 years ago,
when Ortigia was still just the name of a continent.

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:44.540
550 years ago? That's before
the Kingdom of Ortigia was founded.

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:48.250
Vermeil was alive back then?

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:50.710
Sister!

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:57.170
Look, there she is.

00:21:58.710 --> 00:21:59.750
Is that…

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:05.420
Look! I made a flower crown!

00:22:08.790 --> 00:22:10.080
Vermeil!

00:22:16.170 --> 00:22:23.130
Does it get easier with time for the immortal?

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:33.830
If I was born normal, if I become normal, can I stay close?

00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:39.250
With the children, we link our arms

00:22:40.460 --> 00:22:44.460
Make a circle and sing a song

00:22:44.790 --> 00:22:51.210
Knowing there was no chair for me all along

00:22:51.420 --> 00:22:56.500
You locked me into the dark, I'm your preserved flower

00:22:56.500 --> 00:23:00.170
The world is too slow to understand

00:23:00.170 --> 00:23:03.750
Not all blossoms spark, And spikes may be sharp

00:23:03.880 --> 00:23:08.290
They only want to see the beautiful parts

00:23:08.290 --> 00:23:11.670
Sitting in a shower of scarlet rain

00:23:11.670 --> 00:23:16.000
It all used to be ours, I'm counting the hours

00:23:16.000 --> 00:23:19.460
Hours that stood between us like a river

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:21.460
Once I crawled through the water

00:23:21.460 --> 00:23:27.000
All I ever knew have become distant past
